{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「挺好的嘛。\\n　看来你已经和瓜生和好了」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「挺好的嘛。　看来你已经和瓜生和好了」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6982", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啊……是啊……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7516", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这是什么反应」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6983", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不单单只是和好而已……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7517", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「意思是……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6984", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「简直超超超级不得了」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7518", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到今天为止还有点意犹未尽的感觉……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「到今天为止还有点意犹未尽的感觉……」", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7519", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是那种，全身飘飘然的感觉……\\n　尤其是肚子里……嘿嘿……♪」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "「就是那种，全身飘飘然的感觉……　尤其是肚子里……嘿嘿……♪」", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7520", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有、有那么好吃吗？」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6985", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，你指什么？」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7521", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然是巧克力了。你刚才不是在说你们一起吃巧克力，\\n　觉得很好吃吗？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「当然是巧克力了。你刚才不是在说你们一起吃巧克力，　觉得很好吃吗？」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6986", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵……」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7522", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这居高临下的态度又是闹哪样啊」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6987", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀——只是觉得爱理果然不懂呢」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7523", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我确实不太明白，\\n　但总感觉有点火大呢」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「我确实不太明白，　但总感觉有点火大呢」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6988", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早知道就不来找你聊天了。\\n　你慢慢得意去吧，再见」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「早知道就不来找你聊天了。　你慢慢得意去吧，再见」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6989", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊——别走别走我错了！\\n　我实在是太高兴了才这样的，我知道错了，别走嘛爱理」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "「啊——别走别走我错了！　我实在是太高兴了才这样的，我知道错了，别走嘛爱理」", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7524", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「知道是错的那一开始就别做啊。\\n　呼……然后呢，你应该还有话想说吧？」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "「知道是错的那一开始就别做啊。　呼……然后呢，你应该还有话想说吧？」", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6990", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是爱理，太懂我了。\\n　谢谢，那个，怎么说呢……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「不愧是爱理，太懂我了。　谢谢，那个，怎么说呢……」", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7525", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾……其实超肉食系呢」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7526", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6991", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要说到哪种程度，\\n　光是想起昨天的事就………唔……」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "「要说到哪种程度，　光是想起昨天的事就………唔……」", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7527", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃、等等，你没事吧？」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6992", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我没事，而且超级幸福。\\n　已经……回不去了……就这样前往幸福的彼岸……」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "「我没事，而且超级幸福。　已经……回不去了……就这样前往幸福的彼岸……」", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7528", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和新吾一起……啊……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7529", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的没事吗？\\n　从刚才开始你就在抖个不停啊」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「真的没事吗？　从刚才开始你就在抖个不停啊」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6656", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的不是身上哪里出问题了吗？」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6657", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之后又会被怎样呢，平时明明那么温柔，\\n　偶尔又那么热情，令我着迷。\\n　啊啊，新吾新吾新吾……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "「之后又会被怎样呢，平时明明那么温柔，　偶尔又那么热情，令我着迷。　啊啊，新吾新吾新吾……」", "plain_idx": 334, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7530", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看来坏掉的是脑子吗？」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6658", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噢，新吾，你也收到巧克力了吗？」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1800", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，收到了好几个义理巧克力」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟今年情人节在星期天啊～」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1801", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在教室里，女生们正在互相品尝各自余留下来的巧克力（？）。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "在教室里，女生们正在互相品尝各自余留下来的巧克力（？）。", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女生果然很喜欢做这种朋友间互相交换东西的行为啊。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "女生果然很喜欢做这种朋友间互相交换东西的行为啊。", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和你的真命天女怎么样了？」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1802", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，托你的福」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗，能顺利就再好不过了」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1803", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太那边呢？感觉……问了有点不识趣呢」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，毕竟也没什么值得说的」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1804", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「光让我一个人说也太狡猾了吧」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是看你一副想炫耀的样子，\\n　才问你的好吧？」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": "「我是看你一副想炫耀的样子，　才问你的好吧？」", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1805", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听见隼太这么说，我下意识地摸了摸自己的脸。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来我的得意都已经表现到脸上来了吗……", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一直以为我很擅长控制自己的表情的。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过话说回来——」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "「不过话说回来——」", "plain_idx": 360, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1806", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，在这呢。你们两个男生在聊什么呢？\\n　我正闲着，也算我一个呗」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "「啊，在这呢。你们两个男生在聊什么呢？　我正闲着，也算我一个呗」", "plain_idx": 363, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5072", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聊着聊着，走进教室的纱凪走到了我身旁。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后笑着用肩顶了顶我。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇，新吾，这是什么？！」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5073", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，啊。这是班上的同学送我的义理巧克力」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么？！\\n　怎么能收除了我以外的人的巧克力」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": "「什么？！　怎么能收除了我以外的人的巧克力」", "plain_idx": 371, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5074", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，但这只是义理的嘛」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不许狡辩，全都由我没收了」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5075", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿嘿，大丰收大丰收♪\\n　爱理，我拿到不少巧克力，一起吃吧～」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": "「嘿嘿嘿，大丰收大丰收♪　爱理，我拿到不少巧克力，一起吃吧～」", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5076", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪拿走东西后就去找濑名同学了。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": "纱凪拿走东西后就去找濑名同学了。", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗……」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1807", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什么好笑的」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯怎么说呢，有种很自然的感觉啊」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1808", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自然？」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是小乾在你身边有种很自然的感觉」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1809", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是吗？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「恋人之间的相处就是会在不知不觉间变得自然啊」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1810", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太也是啊」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，你指什么？」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1811", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这之前我和纱凪一起逛街的时候，\\n　不是遇见了隼太和你女朋友吗？」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "「这之前我和纱凪一起逛街的时候，　不是遇见了隼太和你女朋友吗？」", "plain_idx": 395, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个时候我就对纱凪说过」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太他们看起来和我们不一样，\\n　感觉相处得很自然呢」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": "「隼太他们看起来和我们不一样，　感觉相处得很自然呢」", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是有一天，\\n　我们也能像他们一样就好了……\\n　那时候还蛮憧憬你们的」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": "「要是有一天，　我们也能像他们一样就好了……　那时候还蛮憧憬你们的」", "plain_idx": 400, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1812", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们居然是被这样看待的吗」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1813", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自己果然注意不到吗？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过也就是这么回事吧。\\n　男人和女人之间……」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": "「不过也就是这么回事吧。　男人和女人之间……」", "plain_idx": 407, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1814", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果在隼太的眼里我们也像他们一样自然地相处在一起，\\n我还挺高兴的。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": "如果在隼太的眼里我们也像他们一样自然地相处在一起，我还挺高兴的。", "plain_idx": 410, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过我觉得你们俩真的很合适啊。你和小乾」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1815", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近纱凪已经可爱到让我有些头疼了」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈哈，你看起来可一点都不头疼啊」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1816_01", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来是被当作在发狗粮了。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，还剩半个月美羽学姐就要毕业了吗……」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5077", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽羽不会留级吗？」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0472", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然不会。\\n　学姐可是很聪明的，又不像我」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": "「当然不会。　学姐可是很聪明的，又不像我」", "plain_idx": 422, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5078", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那边的笨蛋就留级吧」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0473", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说你从哪听来的留级这词啊」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5079", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这不是很正常的事吗？」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0474", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一点都不好玩，好～没意思」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5080", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央依然有着不属于他这个年龄的知识，纱凪的表情则有些复杂。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近理央经常到活动室来玩。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，等学姐毕业之后，\\n　这个社团该何去何从啊……」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": "「唉，等学姐毕业之后，　这个社团该何去何从啊……」", "plain_idx": 435, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5081", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「会惨不忍睹吧」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0475", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少说这种不吉利的话。\\n　只要我还在就绝对不会发生这种事」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": "「少说这种不吉利的话。　只要我还在就绝对不会发生这种事」", "plain_idx": 440, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5082", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾怎么看？」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0476", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么怎么看？」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个惨不忍睹的胸部」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0477", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噢——」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的胸部才没有惨不忍睹好吧。\\n　新吾也是，你在那“噢——”个什么劲啊！」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": "「我的胸部才没有惨不忍睹好吧。　新吾也是，你在那“噢——”个什么劲啊！」", "plain_idx": 449, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5083", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "拼命地挤着胸部让其显得大一点的纱凪真可爱。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算是我……只要挤一挤，也是会变大的啊」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5084", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你平时都在让她做那种无用功吗？」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0478", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可没有」", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻地带过了这个话题。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然并没有让她做这种事，不过要是弄得不好，\\n说不定会搞出什么爆炸发言来。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": "虽然并没有让她做这种事，不过要是弄得不好，说不定会搞出什么爆炸发言来。", "plain_idx": 459, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟聊到这些总会让人想到各种各样的事。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，这个话题到此为止。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等学姐毕业以后，最大的就是安洁，然后是爱理，\\n　对手是小樱吗……」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": "「等学姐毕业以后，最大的就是安洁，然后是爱理，　对手是小樱吗……」", "plain_idx": 463, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5085", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪你在嘀咕什么呢……」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪嘀咕着，\\n站在我身边用胸靠着我。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": "纱凪嘀咕着，站在我身边用胸靠着我。", "plain_idx": 467, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
