{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "并不是看气氛如此才这样做。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是身体自己就动了起来。", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "并没有故意去做。", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对了，刚才关于胸的话题……」", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5095", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是想起了什么，纱凪转变了话题，\\n看向这边说道。", "text_idx": 519, "plain": "像是想起了什么，纱凪转变了话题，看向这边说道。", "plain_idx": 520, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的胸确实很小，没有什么起伏。\\n　这是事实」", "text_idx": 521, "plain": "「我的胸确实很小，没有什么起伏。　这是事实」", "plain_idx": 522, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5096", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
